() Tj T*
(1. PURPOSE) Tj T*
(This procedure describes weigh room cleaning at the Northfield site.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(2. SCOPE) Tj T*
(Applies to production and warehouse staff.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(3. RESPONSIBILITIES) Tj T*
(Production owns this procedure; Quality approves it.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(4. SAFETY) Tj T*
(Wear nitrile gloves and safety glasses when handling the material.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(5. PROCEDURE) Tj T*
(Step 1: Record the batch number in the logbook.) Tj T*
(Step 2: Verify the result in accordance to the acceptance criterion.) Tj T*
(Step 3: Ensure that the second-person check is signed.) Tj T*
(Step 4: Send the completed record to Quality by e-mail.) Tj T*
(Step 5: Check the area is clear of the previous product and its labels.) Tj T*
(Step 6: Confirm the equipment status label shows clean and in date.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(6. RECORDS) Tj T*
(Records are kept for five years after batch expiry.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
